sif) n’a pas d’apostrophe.","type":"choix","options":[{"id":"a","texte":"The house is old, but their roof is new."},{"id":"b","texte":"The house is old, but its roof is new."},{"id":"c","texte":"The house is old, but it’s roof is new."},{"id":"d","texte":"The house is old, but hers roof is new."}],"multiple":false},{"enonce":"Tom retrouve le foulard d’Anna. Complète la question qu’il pose.","aide":"On demande à qui appartient le foulard.","type":"trous","segments":[0," scarf is this? — It’s Anna’s."],"banque":["Who’s","Whose","Who","Which"]}]}$ex$::jsonb,
